seg-97a4147e002c = In the engine run, range-only geometry at one instant has rank { "2" } of { "4" }, so a dilution of precision is undefined; the full state becomes observable after a { "2.09" } h arc.

# text
seg-879b68e63984 = Adding range rate lifts the instantaneous rank from { "2" } to { "4" }: a Doppler-capable link makes a snapshot solution exist where a range-only link cannot.

